{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736800/extras/mainGif_english.gif?t=1749591035\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">RPG x Roguelike x Party-builder</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Speedy, Extra-turn command battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Synergy of various characters and skills, Freedom party building</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pixel art-like style cute characters, Unique graphics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fusion of RPG and Roguelike</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Eat only the best parts of RPGs. It's okay if you don't have the time or energy to play a full-length RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Even if each run is short, you can enjoy the best parts of RPGs, such as character growth, party building, obtaining rare items, and battling strong enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is a Roguelike game, so it is replayable and you can play with various builds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Battle System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You get an extra turn when you break an enemy by hitting their weakness. (ReAct System)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736800/extras/setumei-react.png?t=1749591035\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Party-builder game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine a variety of characters, skills, and equipment to create powerful combos and build your own strongest party. It all depends on your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Roguelike game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When a party is defeated, everything is reset and the skills and equipment obtainable are randomly changed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can enjoy the fun of creating a new party build each time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-----</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is under development. I may update the store page from time to time as development progresses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you are interested in this game, please add it to your wishlist!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3736800?t=1749591035","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3736800?t=1749591035","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736800/fc48beade32812fa832a83dd590c37e045844c71/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749591035","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736800/fc48beade32812fa832a83dd590c37e045844c71/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749591035","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736800/extras/mainGif_english.gif?t=1749591035\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">RPG x Roguelike x Party-builder</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Speedy, Extra-turn command battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Synergy of various characters and skills, Freedom party building</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pixel art-like style cute characters, Unique graphics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fusion of RPG and Roguelike</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Eat only the best parts of RPGs. It's okay if you don't have the time or energy to play a full-length RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Even if each run is short, you can enjoy the best parts of RPGs, such as character growth, party building, obtaining rare items, and battling strong enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is a Roguelike game, so it is replayable and you can play with various builds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Battle System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You get an extra turn when you break an enemy by hitting their weakness. (ReAct System)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736800/extras/setumei-react.png?t=1749591035\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Party-builder game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine a variety of characters, skills, and equipment to create powerful combos and build your own strongest party. It all depends on your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Roguelike game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When a party is defeated, everything is reset and the skills and equipment obtainable are randomly changed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can enjoy the fun of creating a new party build each time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-----</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is under development. I may update the store page from time to time as development progresses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you are interested in this game, please add it to your wishlist!</p>","developers":["Lapismine"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736800/4c80d93240f8ed77a6f72fb727da344bdf342774/header.jpg?t=1749591035","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257154930,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257154930/movie480.mp4?t=1749591033","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257154930/movie_max.mp4?t=1749591033"},"name":"1st Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257154930/044983811b7f6b63e79bdde37d743faf76ad90cd/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749591033","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257154930/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749591033","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257154930/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749591033"}}],"name":"Dungeon Picnic","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL support, VRAM 1GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Lapismine"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"To be announced"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736800/93019dd46dcc619aa75535e40a479581f2437ccf/ss_93